WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
The light-Bushin prerequisite leaves Ryu near the wall; Kimberly already has the visible Level-3 buff.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:00.950
The crouching jab intentionally whiffs during wake-up.

3
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.400
Kimberly walks back outside Ryu’s attempted throw.

4
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.900
Standing heavy punch punishes the missed throw.

5
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.950
The run-stop heavy-kick target conversion reaches Sprint slide.

6
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:05.900
Light Bushin extends the corner conversion.

7
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:06.200
Ryu falls from the completed corner punish.
